DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41667::$$$message_0325_0000_0000$$$::"'Saber's butt, #1.[br]It first appeared on a phone card and a bath towel.'"::
41668::$$$message_0325_0001_0000$$$::"The underwear outfit version (Left) was on a phone card that came as a bonus when FSN first came out. The pajama outfit version (Right) was a life-sized print on a bath towel sold at Summer Comiket in 2004.[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(中)] Ah, she's so easy on the eyes."::
41669::$$$message_0325_0002_0000$$$::"...Th-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]this is...!"::
41670::$$$message_0325_0003_0000$$$::"Nngh, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]you knew about it, Saber?"::
41671::$$$message_0325_0004_0000$$$::"I have heard of a Servant class that exercises its power the more one removes their clothes."::
41672::$$$message_0325_0005_0000$$$::"If memory serves, it is called the Ninja class! On the off chance that I am summoned as this class, would I have to fight in such a defenseless state...? How disheartening..."::
41673::$$$message_0325_0006_0000$$$::"That's not all. [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=3]You'd have to end all your sentences with 'nin-nin'!"::
41674::$$$message_0325_0007_0000$$$::"I ask of you: Are you my nin-nin?"::
41675::$$$message_0325_0008_0000$$$::"Someone's got you hook, line, and sinker."::

